claude: true
prompt: |
  You are working on Alien::Tree::Sitter, an Alien::Base distribution vendoring
  tree-sitter 0.20.8 as a static libtree-sitter.a. Read
  .claude/rules/alien-tree-sitter-rules.md, then pick the top actionable ticket
  from the karr board and drive it to review. Delegate behavior-relevant work
  (the alienfile, lib/Alien/Tree/Sitter.pm, t/) to alien-tree-sitter-worker.
  Never run dzil release.
